# Superseded by the WebP art the arcade actually loads. The PNG originals stay
# in the repo as the re-encode source but never need to ship.
assets/art/*.png

# Only the avatar models the registry actually serves. The directory also holds
# 28 iteration files, about 115 MB, which no avatar references. Guarded by
# test/art-shipping.test.ts so a newly added avatar cannot be dropped silently.
assets/avatars/models/*
!assets/avatars/models/origin-gundam.glb
!assets/avatars/models/extreme-gundam-balanced-walk.optimized.glb
